OL,3,AProperty firm told to repay customers
OL,4,Athousands over 'unfair' sales tactics
OL,5,
OL,6,FA property sales company has to pay
OL,7,Fback more than #277,000 to customers
OL,8,Facross the UK after a watchdog found it
OL,9,Fhad treated buyers unfairly by
OL,10,Fmisrepresenting rental incomes.
OL,12,FLet Property is facing "unprecedented"
OL,13,Flevels of repayments after the UK
OL,14,FProperty Ombudsman received nearly 200
OL,15,Fcomplaints.
OL,17,FCustomers paid the company upfront fees
OL,18,Fof about #3,000 each to reserve
OL,19,Fbuy-to-let properties - but deals later
OL,20,Ffell through after valuations and
OL,21,Frental income projections were found to
OL,22,Fbe misleading.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
