OL,3,AProperty firm told to repay customers
OL,4,Athousands over 'unfair' sales tactics
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow-based Let Property said
OL,7,Fcustomers had "experienced
OL,8,Fdifficulties" during transactions in
OL,9,FEngland, but it remained committed to
OL,10,Fimproving its service and treating
OL,11,Fcustomers fairly.
